- Nina Simone
    - category: music
    - Something is very special about her. There is a power in her works that overtakes you. I believe a lot of people have written much about her, so I'm not going to try. But there are songs that will never get old. "Feeling Good" is one of them an probably the most famous one. Slightly less famous but still powerful is "He Needs Me".
